From bd78885a22a060c6891a50ae7fef7fb89915e3e1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:55:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] avalanche: preverify ready responses across peers without
 reordering dispatch

Batch already-ready isolated responses across peer keys, retaining ordinary
ordered message consumption, poll binding, fault attribution and key checks.
Bound copied heads, per-message bytes and total copied bytes; do not wait for
new traffic. Preserve existing contiguous per-peer burst handling.

Includes ownership/key-rotation/disconnect/malformed-message cases and matched
component benchmarks. No daemon throughput improvement is claimed.

Source provenance: 8cb2b44b17 + 71403f0564 + iterator include 2371b224.
Shared insertion follows AVARESPONSE owner da60f85abd; legacy Schnorr collector
prerequisite 8a3f993145 is already present. Endpoint build/focused/component
results do not independently validate this earlier prefix build.

